# Boost on 30's end save (run.py hgss_boost: np_save4 set-move on a member already in the party).
# HeartGold 27's boost gave FERALIGATR (slot 5, added in 25 with Strength/Whirlpool/Waterfall/Dig) Dragon Pulse over
# Dig for Clair (and Ice Beam over Whirlpool; Pelipper carries Whirlpool from 28). SoulSilver digs out of Lugia's
# cave (32's fly step, dig = true), so Dig goes back over Dragon Pulse.
party-move 5 3 MOVE_DIG
